  << /ActualText (Sole product designer on a consumer learning app\054 leading the V2\055to\055V3 redesign shipped on iOS and Android\056\nPartnered with the founders on product strategy\054 shaping priorities and what to build next\056\nReframed the product around a journey\055based learning experience with Guided Practice at its core\056\nBuilt the design system from scratch in Figma\054 using AI\055assisted workflows for variables and components\054 then refining and scaling it across the product\056\nUsed Amplitude to guide post\055launch iteration and worked with the development team in Hungary through planning\054 development\054 and release\056)
